<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνερᾰν-ίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.963b
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηράνικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Vit.</u>
					p.24J.
				</span></i>
			:— <i>join in contributing, contribute
			jointly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χρείας ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.38
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>receive contributions</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>collect, gather</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραδείγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.963b
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγα ἐκ τῆς γραφῆς ῥήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					21.252d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ . . ἐκ πλειόνων -ισμέναι δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.386
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνηρανισμένον ἐκ
			συγκλύδων</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκλυδος</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ὄχλου</span>
			<i>collected by chance contributions</i> from . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				369a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Isoc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.295
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.676
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18(1).193
			</span></i>.</div>
